# "Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk": every Merfolk but the Lord itself, whoever controls it (CR 613.4c, 613.1f).
# Bot1's Lord of Atlantis makes Bot2's Hullbreacher, a Merfolk, 4/3 with islandwalk, and is itself 2/2 without it. Bot2
# attacks with the Hullbreacher and Llanowar Elves: Bot1 controls an Island, so the Lord can't block the Hullbreacher (CR
# 702.14c), and blocks the Elves instead.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Lord of Atlantis
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Hullbreacher
Llanowar Elves
Forest x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lord of Atlantis.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Hullbreacher.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Hullbreacher.Power = 4
? Bot2.Battlefield.Hullbreacher.Toughness = 3
? Bot2.Battlefield.Hullbreacher.Keywords = Flash; Islandwalk
? Bot1.Battlefield.Lord of Atlantis.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Lord of Atlantis.Keywords = (absent)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Hullbreacher; Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
! Bot1.Block(Lord of Atlantis > Hullbreacher)
Bot1.Block(Lord of Atlantis > Llanowar Elves)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 16
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield.Lord of Atlantis.Damage = 1
